explicitMermaid.prompt:
请把下面的 Mermaid 转成可交付的图解，保留全部实体、字段、键和关系两端的基数：
```mermaid
erDiagram
  AUTHOR ||--o{ BOOK : writes
  BOOK ||--|{ EDITION : "published as"
  PUBLISHER |o--o{ EDITION : prints
  AUTHOR {
    bigint id PK
    varchar name
  }
  BOOK {
    bigint id PK
    bigint author_id FK
    varchar title
  }
  EDITION {
    bigint id PK
    bigint book_id FK
    bigint publisher_id FK
    date published_on
  }
  PUBLISHER {
    bigint id PK
    varchar name UK
  }
```
